  "description": "Test web applications from inside a TestFramework timeline: REST APIs, the SQL Server databases behind them, and the dependencies they call. Provides identifier-driven configuration, variable-backed HTTP requests and SQL statements, row artifacts with automatic teardown, liveness probes, stub declarations with request verification, and request authentication including Windows Negotiate.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
  "id": "TestFramework.Web",
  "isPrerelease": false,
